{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/spectralgraphtheory\/graphprotocols\/graph\/resistancedistance(from:to:weight:tolerance:maxiterations:)-4cudc"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The resistance distance between "},{"code":"source","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"target","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (Klein and Randić 1993): the effective"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"resistance between them when each edge is a conductance (its weight; 1 without "},{"code":"weight:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(e_s − e_t)ᵀ L⁺ (e_s − e_t). 0 when they are the same vertex, without reading any weight;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"nil when they lie in different components. Symmetric. To read weights as resistances"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instead, pass "},{"code":"{ 1 \/ r($0) }","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"metadata":{"extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P08SpectralA6TheoryE18resistanceDistance4from2to6weight9tolerance13maxIterationsSdSg6VertexQz_AMqd__5Edges_5IndexQZXESdSiSgtAA13NoConvergenceVYKSBRd__lF","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"resistanceDistance"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"W"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"from"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"to"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0